:"Maryland Fight Song","title":"Learn the Maryland Fight Song","subtitle":"UMD’s 1941 fight song","notes":"Use the university’s lyrics and audio page to learn the fight song, then listen for it as Terps rally around athletic events and campus spirit.","short_summary":"The official 1941 fight song gives the recurring “Go Terps” refrain a campus home.","evidence_claim":"UMD identifies the Maryland Fight Song as a 1941 work by Ralph Davis ’42, copyrighted by the University of Maryland Student Government Association.","source_url":"https://umd.edu/about/songs","source_title":"Songs | University of Maryland","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Lyrics and an audio player are available on the university page.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
